  "description": "When you slather eggplant with harissa paste and honey and pop it in the oven, it transforms into a melt-in-your-mouth veggie that deserves centrestage on your plate. Serve with oregano potatoes and a fetta-adorned salad, plus a creamy garlic yoghurt and sprinkle of pistachios for the finishing touch. This recipe is under 650kcal per serving. The recent wet weather conditions across the East Coast have impacted our regular supply of fresh ingredients and as such, what you receive may be slightly different to what’s pictured. Don’t worry, your recipe will be just as delicious!",
